<?php /** @var list<array<string,mixed>> $rows */ /** @var int $total */ /** @var int $page */ /** @var int $perPage */ /** @var array<string,mixed> $filters */ /** @var array<string,mixed> $qs */ /** @var bool $canCreate */
$sel = static fn (string $a, string $b): string => $a === $b ? ' selected' : ''; ?>
<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Billing</p><h1>Quotations</h1></div><?php if ($canCreate) : ?><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/quotations/new">New quotation</a><?php endif; ?></div>
<form method="get" action="/quotations" class="toolbar" role="search"><div class="field"><label for="q">Search</label><input id="q" name="q" type="search" maxlength="100" value="<?= e($filters['q']) ?>"></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="s">Status</label><select id="s" name="status"><option value="">All</option><?php foreach (['draft' => 'Draft', 'sent' => 'Sent', 'accepted' => 'Accepted', 'rejected' => 'Declined', 'expired' => 'Expired', 'withdrawn' => 'Withdrawn'] as $c => $l) : ?><option value="<?= e($c) ?>"<?= $sel($filters['status'], $c) ?>><?= e($l) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div>
    <div class="field"><button class="btn btn-ghost" type="submit">Filter</button></div></form>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Quotation</th><th>Client</th><th class="num">Total</th><th>Valid until</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <?php foreach ($rows as $r) : ?><tr><td><a href="/quotations/<?= e($r['public_id']) ?>"><strong><?= e($r['reference']) ?></strong></a><br><span class="muted"><?= e($r['title']) ?></span></td><td><?= e($r['client_name']) ?></td><td class="num"><?= e(money($r['total_minor'])) ?></td><td><?= $r['valid_until'] ? e(local_date($r['valid_until'])) : '—' ?></td><td><span class="badge badge-bq-<?= e($r['status']) ?>"><?= e(['draft' => 'Draft', 'sent' => 'Sent', 'accepted' => 'Accepted', 'rejected' => 'Declined', 'expired' => 'Expired', 'withdrawn' => 'Withdrawn'][$r['status']] ?? $r['status']) ?></span></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?>
    <?php if ($rows === []) : ?><tr><td colspan="5" class="muted">No quotations.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div>
<?= \Vertex\Core\View::partial('pagination', ['page' => $page, 'perPage' => $perPage, 'total' => $total, 'filters' => $qs]) ?>
